{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50851","headline":"奉和元孚大德（亦依本韵） · 王謩","name":"奉和元孚大德（亦依本韵）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华顶高峯接太虚，承攀琪树赋垂珠。\n当时惟有建公在，老宿如今一半无。\n（见明陶宗仪《古刻丛钞》，与元孚诗同刻一石。\n）（案诗原署「中散大夫行台州司马赐鱼袋王謩幷书」。\n又刻後纪「唐大中九年岁次乙亥八月丁丑朔六日壬午重题，以纪他年之事」，共廿六字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王謩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}